SUMMARY:Learning Planet Youth Design Challenge
DESCRIPTION:The Learning Planet Youth Design Challenge (LPYDC) is a launchpad for youth-led social impact projects.  The participants\, aged between 15 and 26\, pitch projects online that can create real-world impact in their communities.  Projects should align with one of the following themes:  Peace & Democracy Mental Health & Wellbeing Environment & Climate Details: https://swabud.tech/opportunities/learning-planet-youth-design-challenge.html
URL:https://swabud.tech/opportunities/learning-planet-youth-design-challenge.html
